{"id": "country", "ids": "⿴囗⿰人人", "title": "People's Enclosure", "pronunciation": "zhòng", "meaning": "People gathered within walls—a nation defined by its inhabitants", "etymology": "The traditional character for country, 國 (guó), encloses 玉 (jade) within\nwalls—the state defined by its treasure. This variant replaces the jade\nwith ⿰人人: two people side by side. A country is not its wealth but its\npeople. The enclosure 囗 becomes not a fortress but a gathering place.\n", "components": [{"char": "囗", "meaning": "enclosure, walls", "role": "outer"}, {"char": "人", "meaning": "person", "role": "inner-left"}, {"char": "人", "meaning": "person", "role": "inner-right"}], "examples": [{"text": "真正的⿴囗⿰人人，是以人为本的国家。", "translation": "A true people's-enclosure is a nation built around its people."}], "tags": ["political", "humanist", "structural"], "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\">\n<style>@import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@400;700&display=swap\");</style>\n<g transform=\"translate(44.68,27.44) scale(0.633636,0.556099) translate(-179.00,816.00) scale(1,-1)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" paint-order=\"stroke fill\">\n  <path d=\"M 269 744 Q 257 756 237 763 Q 225 770 212 765 Q 202 759 209 744 Q 231 657 234 646 Q 234 306 200 169 Q 179 87 219 39 Q 231 23 244 37 Q 254 50 258 68 L 264 110 Q 268 144 268 196 Q 286 686 292 701 C 295 726 293 727 269 744 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n  <path d=\"M 707 92 Q 738 52 761 15 Q 771 -6 784 -5 Q 803 -4 820 35 Q 841 80 836 133 Q 823 317 817 657 Q 816 696 836 723 Q 846 739 836 751 Q 812 775 748 804 Q 726 816 707 804 Q 613 771 469 756 Q 333 743 269 744 C 239 744 262 698 292 701 Q 317 702 652 745 Q 707 752 734 729 Q 753 707 762 577 Q 769 450 763 281 Q 757 178 753 135 Q 750 123 743 120 C 734 92 689 116 707 92 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n  <path d=\"M 258 68 Q 265 67 276 68 Q 415 89 707 92 C 737 92 764